<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Blixus</defName>
    <label>blixus</label>
    <description>Blixus were rare, half-shelled crustapod creatures native to the planet Sljee. These semi-aquatic predators were known to be deadly in the swamps and lagoons they inhabit. They were known to periodically shed their exoskeleton if broken or damaged which could be harvested for useful chitin. It is believed many were accidently transplanted to various worlds as exotic display animals or pets that grew too large to contain.</description>
